  <p>
    Importantly, none of this is imposed by the infrastructure. The proxy's cookie-to-Bearer logic
    works identically inside a server component, and one app in the repo already reads the profile
    API directly from an async server page with the same auth setup. The client-fetch architecture
    is <strong>a choice, not a constraint</strong>, which is exactly why it is fixable.
  </p>

